  "content": "Imāya dhammānudhamma-paṭipattiyā buddhaṃ pūjemi.Imāya dhammānudhamma-paṭipattiyā dhammaṃ pūjemi.Imāya dhammānudhamma-paṭipattiyā saṅghaṃ pūjemi.Addhā imāya paṭipattiyā jātijarāmaraṇamhā parimuccissāmi.Iminā puññakammena mā me bālasamāgamo.Sataṃ samāgamo hotu, yāva nibbānapattiyā.",
